    "sub_name": "校內企業專題(二)",
    "sub_ename": "CAMPUS ENTERPRISE TOPICS (2)",
    "describe_ch": "指導學生進行企業實際專題，以培育其面對與處理企業實務問題能力，與經驗的累積。每一位學生必須經指導教授選定題目，由數位同學成一組完成專題，並經評審後通過。",
    "describe_eh": "Instruct students to conduct practical business topics to cultivate their ability to face and deal with business practical problems, and to accumulate experience. Each student must select a topic by the instructor, a group of several students will complete the topic, and pass it after review.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
